AUTOSCALING:-       
        autoscaling is a service that auyomayically adjust thee number of resources (such as ec2 instance ) based on application demand 
        autoscaling is a service that automatically increase or decrease aws resources according to application demand to ensure hight avalibility
        automaticaaly add resouces when traffic increase 
        automatically removes resouce when traffic decrese 
        helps maintain application performance & availibilty
        reduce the cost by using only the required resources 
        works with service like amazon web service, ec2, ecs, dyanpdb


